{"id":2852,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>11月26日下午，人文社会科学学院在15106H教室成功举办了20251002期“俊彦讲坛”。本期讲坛特邀人文社会科学学院金屏老师担任主讲嘉宾，她以《诗人与公民：19世纪俄国知识分子的社会关怀》为题，进行了深入的学术分享。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnmlqsL4CaM8nVLp4G4n7nfM8MkU4GviMln7oR9YUm-PnRv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRUSy8MYysLR9iUlQVMRlaL8r7M4TfM7r7MR-YM7CYLmAFL4lbnzTVnNnFLzlsnm7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7CA477085AFE4503ED79A4ED4224F228/359E9EFD/157F1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnmlqsL4CaM8nVLp4G4n7nfM8MkU4GviMln7oR9YUm-PnRv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRUSy8MYysLR9iUlQVMRlaL8r7M4TfM7r7MR-YM7CYLmAFL4lbnzTVnNnFLzlsnm7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\"></p><p>金屏老师以19世纪俄国知识分子群体为核心，阐释了“诗人”与“公民”双重身份下的精神内核。她细致入微地剖析了《诗人与公民》诗作中知识分子的身份挣扎，对比了纯艺术派与革命民主派的文学立场差异，揭示了普希金、屠格涅夫等“俄罗斯的良心”以文字介入时代的社会担当。同时，她还详细介绍了从俄国诗人到王笛、梁鸿等当代学者的精神呼应，提出“有良知的学问”的核心内涵。她指出，这些研究将为理解知识分子的时代责任提供新的思考维度。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnNlqbozLsolUbUpllsMlLDUNr7nNUvZM8lbMRlPU8C8L4G0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYMkh7n1yPMRv8LmlbnzGDUlC8MmLiM8CPM4-ZLm-DnR6FL8CbM4LZLzrFM8UanlUJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/524DF1474259E06AF46357F1728226D7/3F973815/7D0ED\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnNlqbozLsolUbUpllsMlLDUNr7nNUvZM8lbMRlPU8C8L4G0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYMkh7n1yPMRv8LmlbnzGDUlC8MmLiM8CPM4-ZLm-DnR6FL8CbM4LZLzrFM8UanlUJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QM4Aq7L8l4U4ffnpRA2nRUbUlMRUmUvPMmMVUmC8LzCYUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPLkh2UShRM4-PM4ffMRTRMNlPnlVfoRA7MNL4MzG8MRnFL4f7nRrRLmnFLl-YU8UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/610FAC72170A49C6E1EAA88D6C350444/30DD5C24/1B2CD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QM4Aq7L8l4U4ffnpRA2nRUbUlMRUmUvPMmMVUmC8LzCYUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPLkh2UShRM4-PM4ffMRTRMNlPnlVfoRA7MNL4MzG8MRnFL4f7nRrRLmnFLl-YU8UJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次讲坛兼具深度与温度，让在场学生对知识分子的社会关怀有了更深刻的体悟，为后续学术探索与价值追求注入了思想动力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QMRLqYUzM2oRQRLp8lZMmCYUzCbUz7viMzvaUlL4ozf2nz90gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDoSyPLkh2MzM7M8r2nRQVoRlPMlCiozUbMzVfUm9iM8QFoR-DUlUZMlWFLzGsU4lJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B6910F53D7EFD6E8515F594951AB857F/826AD85B/107C5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QMRLqYUzM2oRQRLp8lZMmCYUzCbUz7viMzvaUlL4ozf2nz90gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDoSyPLkh2MzM7M8r2nRQVoRlPMlCiozUbMzVfUm9iM8QFoR-DUlUZMlWFLzGsU4lJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg\"></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://shss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=QnmlqsL4CaM8nVLp4G4n7nfM8MkU4GviMln7oR9YUm-PnRv0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRUSy8MYysLR9iUlQVMRlaL8r7M4TfM7r7MR-YM7CYLmAFL4lbnzTVnNnFLzlsnm7Jqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aMzUsgtA8pU6cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=10547&e=.jpg"}